{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>On this planet destined to perish, let's embark on the ultimate chill journey.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/27cbf8e2b45e28a92f3c942e74adfeeb.avif?t=1773469650\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meteors rain down, and the world ends.<br>As the world trembles at this shocking news, high school girl Ohara Hinako makes a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf the world's going to end anyway, let's ride across Japan!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unabashedly cheerful Hinako, a positive girl through and through, mounts the motorcycle passed down from her father and departs her hometown of Kagoshima.<br>Her destination: Hokkaido. The place farthest from Kyushu, where she was born and raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel companions join her, places she wants to visit multiply, memories pile up.<br>At the end of this unrestrained, utterly free journey, what will Hinako and her friends think?\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a heartwarming story about savoring a joyful end to the very last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An adventure game where you journey through a world ending via cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/5297bd2a439bd919644c18610cd85034.poster.avif?t=1773469650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/5297bd2a439bd919644c18610cd85034.webm?t=1773469650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/5297bd2a439bd919644c18610cd85034.mp4?t=1773469650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual deck-building adventure game depicts a journey where girls aim to traverse Japan from north to south at the world's end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/6f644f2a8a6c0a714d70ce5ed1123ec4.avif?t=1773469650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras_big/6f644f2a8a6c0a714d70ce5ed1123ec4.avif?t=1773469650 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aim to reach Hokkaido before the world ends, while making detours to various real-world locations to collect items and build decks that give them an advantage in their quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/771a772ed321c1783eb14429e42e3cef.poster.avif?t=1773469650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/771a772ed321c1783eb14429e42e3cef.webm?t=1773469650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/771a772ed321c1783eb14429e42e3cef.mp4?t=1773469650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of your limited time by skillfully planning your itinerary and effectively building your deck to create many memories and enrich your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/2d08b790e970779c695c2d87a518ccc9.avif?t=1773469650\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ohara Hinako:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of this work. A cheerful girl with a custard pudding hair.<br>She was a high school student, but school was closed due to the approaching giant meteorite.<br>Figuring she might as well, she decided to go on a journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/feb94330280d609f039d104352b59056.avif?t=1773469650\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akasaka Mei:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gal you meet while traveling. Vocational school student.<br>She's a gal but has a big sister personality who looks out for others. Surprisingly, she has a girly side too...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/63bc3cd2c1c293aba1e7307c685b6b8a.avif?t=1773469650\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misumi Ruri:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The president's daughter you meet while traveling.<br>She's demure but loves her drinks, and when she gets drunk, she starts taking walks.<br>Also, she has no sense of direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/6d23371c97dac479ce731073c34a19d6.avif?t=1773469650\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midori Shimabukuro:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-spirited musician.<br>A mysterious older sister figure whom Hinako and the others encounter wherever they go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creator Profile</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aozorite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Japanese indie game development team.<br>Formed primarily by participants of the creator server \u201cVelocity,\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it brings together creators working across genres\u2014game creators, illustrators, novelists, programmers, video creators\u2014who advance development using approaches that leverage their respective expertise and sensibilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069400?t=1773469650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/69cac053edd3059e2f6f67170066affba0c873f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773469650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/49d0945e00212d5a19f47c08879053551ee1d418/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773469650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/49d0945e00212d5a19f47c08879053551ee1d418/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773469650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>On this planet destined to perish, let's embark on the ultimate chill journey.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/27cbf8e2b45e28a92f3c942e74adfeeb.avif?t=1773469650\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meteors rain down, and the world ends.<br>As the world trembles at this shocking news, high school girl Ohara Hinako makes a decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf the world's going to end anyway, let's ride across Japan!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unabashedly cheerful Hinako, a positive girl through and through, mounts the motorcycle passed down from her father and departs her hometown of Kagoshima.<br>Her destination: Hokkaido. The place farthest from Kyushu, where she was born and raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel companions join her, places she wants to visit multiply, memories pile up.<br>At the end of this unrestrained, utterly free journey, what will Hinako and her friends think?\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a heartwarming story about savoring a joyful end to the very last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An adventure game where you journey through a world ending via cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/5297bd2a439bd919644c18610cd85034.poster.avif?t=1773469650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/5297bd2a439bd919644c18610cd85034.webm?t=1773469650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/5297bd2a439bd919644c18610cd85034.mp4?t=1773469650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual deck-building adventure game depicts a journey where girls aim to traverse Japan from north to south at the world's end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/6f644f2a8a6c0a714d70ce5ed1123ec4.avif?t=1773469650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras_big/6f644f2a8a6c0a714d70ce5ed1123ec4.avif?t=1773469650 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players aim to reach Hokkaido before the world ends, while making detours to