chool student.<br>She's a gal but has a big sister personality who looks out for others. Surprisingly, she has a girly side too...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/63bc3cd2c1c293aba1e7307c685b6b8a.avif?t=1773469650\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misumi Ruri:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The president's daughter you meet while traveling.<br>She's demure but loves her drinks, and when she gets drunk, she starts taking walks.<br>Also, she has no sense of direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/extras/6d23371c97dac479ce731073c34a19d6.avif?t=1773469650\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midori Shimabukuro:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free-spirited musician.<br>A mysterious older sister figure whom Hinako and the others encounter wherever they go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creator Profile</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aozorite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Japanese indie game development team.<br>Formed primarily by participants of the creator server \u201cVelocity,\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it brings together creators working across genres\u2014game creators, illustrators, novelists, programmers, video creators\u2014who advance development using approaches that leverage their respective expertise and sensibilities.</p>","developers":["aozorite"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069400/c484a3b2eac987f5454259e32d4516afd15f2889/header.jpg?t=1773469650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069400/4